@startuml cgms_alarm_path
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

title CGMS Alarm Path

component Sensor
component MCU
component "Mobile App" as App
component User

Sensor --> MCU : glucose reading
MCU --> MCU : threshold evaluation
MCU --> App : BLE alert event
App --> User : audible / visual alarm

note right of MCU
Latency Requirement:
< 10 seconds
end note

note right of App
Redundancy:
Local alerts even if cloud unavailable
end note

@enduml
